    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics has always been a bridge between abstract thought and tangible problem-solving for me. As someone with a PhD in physics, it’s both my intellectual playground and the language that describes reality—whether it’s solving equations or modeling complex systems. It’s not just about numbers; it’s about patterns, logic, and creativity.",
