    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Yes! I used AI-driven platforms like Wolfram Alpha for quick checks on derivations or symbolic computations. It’s been invaluable for verifying my work without pressure—especially during late-night study sessions. The feedback loop helped me refine my approach and reduce mental load.",
